<li class=3D"py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown=3D"list-item"><span =
class=3D"font-semibold" data-streamdown=3D"strong">Primary:</span> Abyss Na=
vy #0A1931 to #101F3C and Brushed Gold #C9A86A to #E8C87A</li>
<li class=3D"py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown=3D"list-item"><span =
class=3D"font-semibold" data-streamdown=3D"strong">Secondary:</span> Kintsu=
gi Gold vein as a graphic element, not always as background</li>
<li class=3D"py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown=3D"list-item"><span =
class=3D"font-semibold" data-streamdown=3D"strong">Functional:</span> Pure =
flat versions: Gold on Navy, Navy on White, White on Black, and single-colo=
r black and white. Every professional logo must work in single color withou=
t effects.</li>
</ul>
<p>Keep the 3D beveled gold for hero artwork only. Your everyday logo shoul=
d be flat vector.</p>
<h2 class=3D"mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown=3D"heading-2=
">4. Does it fit a music-maker identity?</h2>
<p>Yes, but it positions you very specifically. This is not a playful Sound=
Cloud rapper logo or a minimal techno logo. This is executive, producer, la=
bel-owner energy. It says high production value, expensive beats, longevity=
.</p>
<p>That is a great lane if you lean into it. It will work beautifully for a=
lbum covers, intro animations with light hitting the gold, and premium merc=
h. If your sound is more raw or underground, you will need a rougher second=
ary version to avoid a disconnect.</p>
<h2 class=3D"mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown=3D"heading-2=
">5. How it will work across formats</h2>
<p>Right now this version will struggle:</p>
<ul class=3D"list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;li]:ps-6" da=
ta-streamdown=3D"unordered-list">
<li class=3D"py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown=3D"list-item"><span =
class=3D"font-semibold" data-streamdown=3D"strong">Social avatar / Spotify =
circle:</span> The wide MAGR gets cropped and the middle detail becomes mud=
.</li>
<li class=3D"py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown=3D"list-item"><span =
class=3D"font-semibold" data-streamdown=3D"strong">Merch embroidery, stamp,=
