li>
<li class=3D"py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown=3D"list-item"><span =
class=3D"font-semibold" data-streamdown=3D"strong">Watermark on video / web=
site header:</span> The marble background makes it impossible to overlay.</=
li>
<li class=3D"py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown=3D"list-item"><span =
class=3D"font-semibold" data-streamdown=3D"strong">Small sizes:</span> At 4=
8px the =CE=94/G overlap is illegible.</li>
</ul>
<p>You need a logo system, not one logo.</p>
<h2 class=3D"mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-2xl" data-streamdown=3D"heading-2=
">6. Specific improvements and alternative directions to consider</h2>
<p>Preserving your identity, here is what I would build next:</p>
<p><span class=3D"font-semibold" data-streamdown=3D"strong">A. Create three=
 lockups:</span></p>
<ol class=3D"list-inside list-decimal whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;li]:ps-6"=
 data-streamdown=3D"ordered-list">
<li class=3D"py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown=3D"list-item"><span =
class=3D"font-semibold" data-streamdown=3D"strong">Primary Wordmark:</span>=
 Flat, no background, M=CE=94GOR with perfect optical kerning. All gold or =
all white. The O is a perfect circle containing a clean =CE=94. No G inside=
 it.</li>
<li class=3D"py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown=3D"list-item"><span =
class=3D"font-semibold" data-streamdown=3D"strong">Icon / Stamp:</span> Jus=
