<li class=3D"py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown=3D"list-item"><span =
class=3D"font-semibold" data-streamdown=3D"strong">Hero / Luxury:</span> Yo=
ur current 3D gold on kintsugi marble, reserved for album covers, YouTube b=
anners, and intro visuals.</li>
</ol>
<p><span class=3D"font-semibold" data-streamdown=3D"strong">B. Fix the cent=
ral character:</span><br>
Try this version: The O is a 90% closed circle with a small gap at top righ=
t, classic luxury mark. The =CE=94 sits centered inside, its base aligned w=
ith the O's baseline. The G is its own letter to the right of the O, not me=
rged. This keeps your original idea but makes it read instantly.</p>
<p><span class=3D"font-semibold" data-streamdown=3D"strong">C. Refine const=
ruction:</span></p>
<ol class=3D"list-inside list-decimal whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;li]:ps-6"=
 data-streamdown=3D"ordered-list">
<li class=3D"py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown=3D"list-item">Make M=
 and R exactly the same height and stroke thickness as the O ring.</li>
<li class=3D"py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown=3D"list-item">Reduce=
 letter spacing by 15 to 20% for a tighter, more premium wordmark.</li>
<li class=3D"py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown=3D"list-item">Remove=
 the inner shadow and outer glow for the flat versions. Use vector only.</l=
i>
</ol>
<p><span class=3D"font-semibold" data-streamdown=3D"strong">D. Own the kint=
